1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.064
Today’s lesson goal: Today’s lesson goal: create a simple class in C sharp, add properties and a method, and construct objects and use them.

2
00:00:08.414 --> 00:00:16.838
Classes and objects: A class defines fields or properties. New creates an instance. Methods act on that instance’s data.

3
